Subject: [PATCH 9/9] Round 5 (Reviewer 1): restore upstream
 RemoveECIESx25519Session + new RevokeECIESx25519Session (tag-map scan only on
 revoke); thread-safety rule comment (Destination.h) + ADR-008;
 RemoveKeyRingKey uses Revoke per-key; test hook InsertRemoteLeaseSetForTest +
 cache-eviction tests; brace indentation in cache-write block; matrix cases
 5/7 documented as left to E-1

