+			// decoded before the key removal) MUST run in that thread: when invoked from
+			// another thread (e.g. the future F-8 control channel), post them with
+			// m_Service.post(...), never touch those maps from the calling thread.
+			// Locking order: never hold m_KeyRingMutex and m_RemoteLeaseSetsMutex at the same
